    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔧 Maintenance Request Auto-Triage\nTenant submits → validated → Claude triages → routed (standard / emergency / missing info / manual review) → logged + notified.\n\nBuilt with retries, error handling, and a full audit trail — nothing silently fails.\n\nBuilt by [Your Name] — AI automation for small property management teams.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
